\pard\plain \s61\li360\sa60\sb30\qj\widctlpar\qj\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Constant light attenuation factor.\par
The intensity of the light source at a given distance 'd' from the light's position is {
\par
\pard\plain \s41\li360\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid Atten = 1/( att0 + att1 * d + att2 * d*d)\par
}
 This member corresponds to the att0 variable in the equation. Naturally undefined for directional lights. \par
}}
